OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after two-car collision
OL,4,
OL,5,FA woman, aged in her 70s, has died
OL,6,Ffollowing a two-car collision in the
OL,7,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,9,FThe collision happened close to the
OL,10,FNorthern Ireland border on the N2 at
OL,11,FBroomfield, County Monaghan, on
OL,12,FThursday morning.
OL,14,FBoth drivers of the cars, a woman in
OL,15,Fher 30s and man in his 50s, were
OL,16,Ftransferred to Our Lady of Lourdes
OL,17,FHospital for treatment of serious but
OL,18,Fnon-life-threatening injuries.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
