OL,3,GNEWSAWoman dies after two-car collision
OL,4,
OL,5,FThe road remains closed and gardai
OL,6,F(Irish police) are appealing to anyone
OL,7,Fwho may have witnessed the collision,
OL,8,Fwhich occurred at about 10:10 local
OL,9,Ftime, to contact them.
